  "description": "Disciple and teacher, the distance between two people who seem close yet so far apart.  \nThe dream of a past life unfolds to the high school student present, who struggles with unrequited love as much as the distance.  \nA fateful love that I had no choice but to fall in love with, a deep, dense, drenched emotion.  \nPark Hyun-jae, who wants to have everything about Han Yi-eum, lights a candle and falls into a dream.  \n*(Google translated)*\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/portrait_of_a_dream_)",
